# The curated per-user settings allowlist (Q012, docs/product-decisions.md 2026-10-20). Roamd's capture and the
# chooser's apply both read this file. A setting off this list is never read at seal and never written at sign-in.
#
# One row per line: <scope> <key> [<kind>]
#   scope  secure or system. Never global (Q012).
#   kind   absent for a plain value, or tiles for a comma list of Quick Settings tiles. Only one row has kind tiles.
# A later slice adds a row here and changes no code.
secure sysui_qs_tiles tiles
